    "created_at": "2026-06-15T20:53:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-15T20:53:13Z",
    "body": "I agree removing this makes sense. The dt functions similarly to a heading for the following dd, and there's no problem with headings having repeated names. As shown in Henri's page, it's a perfectly reasonable thing to do.",
